    {"@type":"Question","name":"How much do Mercedes Service A and B cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"At the dealer, Service A often runs $200–$350 and Service B $400–$700+. An independent Mercedes specialist is typically well under those numbers using genuine parts."}},
